{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kami Quest</strong> is a whimsical 3D platformer inspired by the golden age of video games. You play as <strong>Sabbath</strong>, an energetic dalmatian exploring the mysterious, ever-shifting world of the <strong>Imagynasium</strong>, a giant living castle filled with oddball spirits, surreal environments, and secrets tucked into every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into exploration-driven levels, interact with quirky NPCs, and collect keys hidden throughout the castle to uncover the Imagynasium\u2019s deepest mysteries. With a strong emphasis on style, music, and expressive characters, <strong>Kami Quest</strong> is a love letter to childhood wonder and retro platformers. It's a world that feels alive, weird, and worth getting lost in.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857790?t=1755574886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857790?t=1755574886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/ba09222723d5dd43848b665bbc8ef8c121058142/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755574886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/ba09222723d5dd43848b665bbc8ef8c121058142/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755574886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kami Quest</strong> is a whimsical 3D platformer inspired by the golden age of video games. You play as <strong>Sabbath</strong>, an energetic dalmatian exploring the mysterious, ever-shifting world of the <strong>Imagynasium</strong>, a giant living castle filled with oddball spirits, surreal environments, and secrets tucked into every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into exploration-driven levels, interact with quirky NPCs, and collect keys hidden throughout the castle to uncover the Imagynasium\u2019s deepest mysteries. With a strong emphasis on style, music, and expressive characters, <strong>Kami Quest</strong> is a love letter to childhood wonder and retro platformers. It's a world that feels alive, weird, and worth getting lost in.</p>","developers":["KAMI EXP","Infinity Garden Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857790/6c2f62fbb1202f36efd63173e4ca7e1992b4827e/header.jpg?t=1755574886","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3857790/1750054750/5daa040575c7eed29bd3e864f68ee838de49f700/1751526053/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755574885","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3857790/1750054750/5daa040575c7eed29bd3e864f68ee838de49f700/1751526053/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755574885","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3857790/1750054750/5daa040575c7eed29bd3e864f68ee838de49f700/1751526053/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755574885","id":257164781,"name":"KAMI QUEST Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257164781/8db075648c63f733f9d9a6820fce3dfaa69d2c4b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755574885"}],"name":"Kami Quest: Enter the Imagynasium","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060<br